  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3e4b5683c1ea36345958694d590b6436, type: 3}
  m_Name: COC3_Quiz_Final_Review_Q02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizQuestionData
  questionText: The folder's permission list shows Everyone with Full control, inherited
    from the parent folder. Removing it from this folder alone does nothing. Why?
  choices:
  - Everyone cannot be removed from any folder
  - The entry is protected by Windows
  - It has to be removed from the share permissions instead
  - While inheritance is on, the entry comes straight back from the parent
  correctChoiceIndex: 3
  points: 10
  explanation: Inheritance has to be disabled first, which turns the inherited entries
    into this folder's own. Only then can one be removed and stay removed.
